@startuml autoschedule-use-case
' Autoschedule full use-case slice — verified against commit 7f3293a (2026-08-08).
' Slide-legible companion to the exhaustive diagram in docs/autoschedule/diagrams/.

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam classFontSize 13
skinparam ArrowColor #37474F
skinparam classBorderColor #546E7A
skinparam packageBorderColor #90A4AE
skinparam packageFontStyle bold
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
left to right direction

package "Frameworks & Drivers" #F4F7FA {
  class DayPlanPanel <<Swing View>>
  class AutoScheduleSettingsDialog <<Swing View>>
  class ScheduleImprovementsPanel <<Swing View>>
  class InMemoryTripRepository
  class OsrmDistanceService
  class OpenMeteoWeatherService
  class AppBuilder <<composition root>>
}

package "Interface Adapters" #F7F9FB {
  class AutoScheduleController
  class AutoScheduleSettings <<DTO>>
  class AutoSchedulePresenter
  class DayPlanViewModel
  class DayPlanState <<immutable state>>
  class DistanceServiceTravelTimeEstimator <<adapter>>
  class WeatherServiceContextGateway <<adapter>>
}

package "Application Business Rules" #F5FAF6 {
  interface AutoScheduleInputBoundary <<Input Boundary>>
  class AutoScheduleInputData <<Input Data>>
  class AutoScheduleApplyInputData <<Input Data>>
  class AutoScheduleInteractor

  interface AutoScheduleOutputBoundary <<Output Boundary>>
  class AutoSchedulePreviewOutputData <<Output Data>>
  class AutoScheduleConflictOutputData <<Output Data>>

  interface TripRepository <<Data Access>>
  interface TravelTimeEstimator <<gateway>>
  interface WeatherContextGateway <<gateway>>

  class ProblemValidator
  class TravelMatrixPrefetcher
  class ScheduleTask
  class ScheduleEngine <<pure search>>
  class ActivityPlacer
  class ScheduleImprovementFinder
  class ReasonCollector

  interface SoftPolicy <<Strategy>>
  class WeatherSuitabilityPolicy
  class MealWindowPolicy
  class DaylightPolicy
}

package "Entities" #FBF7F0 {
  class Trip <<entity>>
  class ScheduledEvent <<entity>>
  class Activity <<entity>>
  class OpeningHours <<value object>>
}

' layer ordering anchors (invisible): Frameworks -> Adapters -> Application -> Entities
AutoScheduleSettingsDialog -[hidden]-> AutoScheduleSettings
InMemoryTripRepository -[hidden]-> DistanceServiceTravelTimeEstimator
DayPlanState -[hidden]-> AutoScheduleInputData
WeatherServiceContextGateway -[hidden]-> WeatherContextGateway
ScheduleEngine -[hidden]-> Trip
DaylightPolicy -[hidden]-> OpeningHours

' ---- user request path ----
DayPlanPanel --> AutoScheduleSettingsDialog : opens
DayPlanPanel --> AutoScheduleController
AutoScheduleController --> AutoScheduleSettings
AutoScheduleController --> AutoScheduleInputBoundary : preview / apply
AutoScheduleController ..> AutoScheduleInputData : creates
AutoScheduleController ..> AutoScheduleApplyInputData : creates
AutoScheduleInteractor .up.|> AutoScheduleInputBoundary

' ---- what the use case depends on (all inward-owned) ----
AutoScheduleInteractor --> TripRepository
AutoScheduleInteractor --> TravelTimeEstimator : via prefetcher
AutoScheduleInteractor --> WeatherContextGateway
AutoScheduleInteractor --> AutoScheduleOutputBoundary
AutoScheduleInteractor --> ProblemValidator
AutoScheduleInteractor --> TravelMatrixPrefetcher
AutoScheduleInteractor --> ScheduleEngine
AutoScheduleInteractor --> ScheduleImprovementFinder
AutoScheduleInteractor --> ReasonCollector
AutoScheduleInteractor ..> ScheduleTask : builds for trip date
AutoScheduleInteractor ..> AutoSchedulePreviewOutputData : creates
AutoScheduleInteractor ..> AutoScheduleConflictOutputData : creates

ScheduleEngine --> ActivityPlacer
ScheduleEngine --> SoftPolicy : scores placements
WeatherSuitabilityPolicy .up.|> SoftPolicy
MealWindowPolicy .up.|> SoftPolicy
DaylightPolicy .up.|> SoftPolicy

' ---- entities ----
AutoScheduleInteractor --> Trip : loads / replaceSchedule
Trip *-- ScheduledEvent
ScheduledEvent --> Activity
Activity *-- OpeningHours
ScheduleTask --> Activity

' ---- results path ----
AutoSchedulePresenter .up.|> AutoScheduleOutputBoundary
AutoSchedulePresenter --> DayPlanViewModel : setState
DayPlanViewModel --> DayPlanState
DayPlanViewModel ..> DayPlanPanel : property change (Observer)
DayPlanPanel --> ScheduleImprovementsPanel : renders cards

' ---- outer implementations of inner interfaces ----
InMemoryTripRepository .up.|> TripRepository
DistanceServiceTravelTimeEstimator .up.|> TravelTimeEstimator
WeatherServiceContextGateway .up.|> WeatherContextGateway
DistanceServiceTravelTimeEstimator --> OsrmDistanceService
WeatherServiceContextGateway --> OpenMeteoWeatherService

AppBuilder ..> AutoScheduleController : wires everything

note bottom of AppBuilder
  Source dependencies point inward:
  outer classes implement interfaces
  owned by the application layer.
end note
@enduml
